        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Thewlis, Patty Jenkins, Allan Heinberg, Zack Snyder, Jason Fuchs, Gal Gadot, Chris Pine, Robin Wright, Danny Huston, Connie Nielsen, Elena Anaya\n- Works: James and the Giant Peach, The Miracle Maker, Anomalisa, Fargo, Wonder Woman\n- Organizations: FX\n- Concepts: anthology format\n\nFacts:\n- David Thewlis did voice work in James and the Giant Peach in 1996.\n- David Thewlis did voice work in The Miracle Maker in 2000.\n- Fargo premiered on FX on April 15, 2014.\n- Fargo uses an anthology format in which each season is set in a different era and tells a different story with mostly new characters and cast, with minor overlap.\n- David Thewlis did voice work in Anomalisa in 2015.\n- Patty Jenkins directed the 2017 film Wonder Woman.\n- Allan Heinberg wrote the screenplay for Wonder Woman from a story by Allan Heinberg, Zack Snyder, and Jason Fuchs.\n- Wonder Woman stars Gal Gadot, Chris Pine, Robin Wright, Danny Huston, David Thewlis, Connie Nielsen, and Elena Anaya.",
